English word-list data
======================

The Type now English language pack contains selections derived from the
Alt12Dicts word-list package, version 2020.12.07, by Alan Beale and packaged
by Kevin Atkinson:

  https://github.com/en-wl/wordlist/tree/v1/alt12dicts

The Alt12Dicts README states:

  "All of these files have been explicitly placed in the Public Domain by
  Alan Beale."

This is the source's stated rights dedication; the source does not name a
separate SPDX identifier or attach additional license terms.

Standard vocabulary
-------------------

Source: alt12dicts/2of12full.txt
  https://github.com/en-wl/wordlist/blob/v1/alt12dicts/2of12full.txt
Included filtered data: packages/language-packs/src/en/words.json
Selection: lowercase ASCII entries of 2–9 letters. Exact entries listed in
packages/language-packs/src/en/BLOCKLIST.json are excluded at runtime.

Kids vocabulary
---------------

Source: alt12dicts/2of4brif.txt
  https://github.com/en-wl/wordlist/blob/v1/alt12dicts/2of4brif.txt
Included source copy: packages/language-packs/src/en/2of4brif-source.txt
Included filtered data: packages/language-packs/src/en/kids-words.json
Selection: lowercase ASCII entries of 2–6 letters also present in the
standard 2of12full selection. Exact entries listed in
packages/language-packs/src/en/BLOCKLIST.json are excluded at runtime.

The same Alt12Dicts Public Domain dedication applies to both source files.
Letter and bigram statistics are computed from the filtered standard
vocabulary. The blocklist is editorial filtering maintained by this project;
it does not change the source's rights status.
